---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/UI/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/UI/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Digital Secretary Privacy Policy | Paschalis Gkikas"
  description="Detailed privacy policy and data protection information regarding the use of the Digital Secretary (WhatsApp, automation, AI) of the medical practice."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-slate-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Navigation Breadcrumb / Back Link -->
      <div class="mb-6">
        <a href="/en/privacy-policy" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
          </svg>
          Back to Main Privacy Policy
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-10">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Automation Service
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">
          Digital Secretary Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">Last Update: 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-slate-700 space-y-8">
          
          <!-- Operation of the Digital Secretary -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0 mb-4">Operation of the Digital Secretary</h2>
            <p>The Digital Secretary is used via WhatsApp for:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Providing general information.</li>
              <li>Searching for appointment availability.</li>
              <li>Scheduling and rescheduling appointments.</li>
              <li>Sending confirmations and reminders.</li>
              <li>Generating links for online sessions.</li>
              <li>Forwarding requests to the physician when necessary.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 font-medium text-slate-900">
              Its use is optional. It does not perform diagnoses, psychiatric evaluations, treatment proposals, or automated clinical decisions.
            </p>
          </section>

          <hr class="border-slate-100" />

          <!-- Data We Process -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Data We Process</h2>
            <p>Depending on the request, the following may be processed:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Full name and phone number.</li>
              <li>Declaration of adulthood.</li>
              <li>Email address for online appointments.</li>
              <li>Information whether you are a new or existing patient.</li>
              <li>Type, date, and time of appointment.</li>
              <li>Content and technical details of messages.</li>
              <li>Temporary technical data for security and preventing duplicate processing.</li>
            </ul>
            
            <!-- Warning Alert Box -->
            <div class="mt-6 p-5 bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 rounded-r-2xl text-amber-900">
              <div class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
                </svg>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed">
                  Please do not send detailed medical history, laboratory tests, prescriptions, or other unnecessary health data through automated chat.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <hr class="border-slate-100" />

          <!-- Automated Processing -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Automated Processing</h2>
            <p>
              For system operation, messaging, automation, artificial intelligence, electronic calendar, email, and video conferencing services are used.
            </p>
            <p>
              Artificial intelligence is used exclusively to understand and manage administrative requests. When human judgment is required, the request is forwarded to the physician.
            </p>
            <p>
              Certain technical providers may process data outside the European Economic Area under the required legal safeguards.
            </p>
          </section>

          <hr class="border-slate-100" />

          <!-- Purposes and Retention Periods -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Purposes and Retention Periods</h2>
            <p>
              Processing is necessary for managing requests and appointments, providing healthcare services, fulfilling legal obligations, and system security.
            </p>
            <p>
              Temporary scheduling data is retained from 24 hours to 30 days, depending on purpose. Technical data is retained only as long as necessary for security and error investigation.
            </p>
            <p>
              If information is incorporated into the medical record, it is retained in accordance with the law, typically for ten years from the last visit.
            </p>
          </section>

          <hr class="border-slate-100" />

          <!-- Your Rights -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
            <p>
              You can request access, correction, deletion, restriction, portability, or object to processing where these rights apply.
            </p>
            <p>
              Deletion does not apply to data that must be retained due to legal obligation, such as the medical record.
            </p>
            <p>
              Requests can be submitted to <a href="mailto:contact@drgkikas.com" class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900 font-semibold underline">contact@drgkikas.com</a> and are generally answered within one month.
            </p>

            <!-- Emergency Disclaimer Alert Box -->
            <div class="mt-8 p-5 bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-2xl text-red-900">
              <div class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold leading-relaxed">
                  The Digital Secretary is not an emergency service. In case of immediate danger, please contact emergency services.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
